      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per minute\n\nTrigger The Grand Defender's resistance to physical damage is overcome by the resistance's exception\n\n---\n\nEffect The Grand Defender sheds the outer layer of its body, altering its material composition and general appearance. The material that overcomes the Grand Defender's resistance changes to adamantine, cold iron, dawnsilver, or silver (Grand Defender's choice).",
